#
# The base clock, when neither the controller's capabilities nor a fixed clock
# in the device tree give it, is the firmware's EMMC2 clock, whose rate the
# firmware reports through the mailbox, found by the firmware node's
# compatible string.
uses mailbox_v1 via device compatible "raspberrypi,bcm2835-firmware", mboxes { get_clock_rate }
